   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 7.805,
   "duration_sec": 7.805
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "はい。窓のそばの台が傾いています。箱を抱えて動かしてもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D002-S01",
    "C37-D002-S02",
    "C37-D002-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 8.155,
   "end_sec": 14.177,
   "duration_sec": 6.022
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "その前に箱の中を見ましょう。尖った部分があります。布を広げて包んでください。手を放す前に声を掛けてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D003-S01",
    "C37-D003-S02",
    "C37-D003-S03",
    "C37-D003-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 14.527,
   "end_sec": 23.493,
   "duration_sec": 8.966
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "あっ、模型が飛び出しました。バッと手を出しましたが、受け止められませんでした。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D004-S01",
    "C37-D004-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 23.843,
   "end_sec": 30.228,
   "duration_sec": 6.385
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "机に当たりましたね。倒れた台を起こしてから、下の模型を引き出しましょう。壁に手を当てて、台を支えてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D005-S01",
    "C37-D005-S02",
    "C37-D005-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 30.578,
   "end_sec": 38.4,
   "duration_sec": 7.822
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "足を突っ張って支えています。模型は割れていませんが、横の飾りが砕けています。私が弾き飛ばしたのかもしれません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D006-S01",
    "C37-D006-S02",
    "C37-D006-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 38.75,
   "end_sec": 47.166,
   "duration_sec": 8.416
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "今のことも記録しましょう。棚の下に落としたボタンは拾えますか。服のボタンです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D007-S01",
    "C37-D007-S02",
    "C37-D007-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 47.516,
   "end_sec": 53.064,
   "duration_sec": 5.548
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "拾えました。床を濡らしたのも私ですか。流しから水が溢れています。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D008-S01",
    "C37-D008-S02",
    "C37-D008-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 53.414,
   "end_sec": 59.371,
   "duration_sec": 5.957
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "水は先にありました。ホースの先を引き上げてください。今、水を止めます。布で机のインクを取れますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D009-S01",
    "C37-D009-S02",
    "C37-D009-S03",
    "C37-D009-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 59.721,
   "end_sec": 67.974,
   "duration_sec": 8.253
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "はい。ほこりも払います。床には筆が一本と一束の紙があります。濡れた紙は外に放り出していいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D010-S01",
    "C37-D010-S02",
    "C37-D010-S03",
    "C37-D010-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 68.324,
   "end_sec": 77.296,
   "duration_sec": 8.972
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "いいえ、展示に使う紙です。ばらばらの紙を集めましょう。目の前の写真にも水を掛けないでください。処分するのは、写真ではなく、撮影に使った果物です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D011-S01",
    "C37-D011-S02",
    "C37-D011-S03",
    "C37-D011-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 77.646,
   "end_sec": 89.335,
   "duration_sec": 11.689
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "わかりました。犬一頭と鳥二羽の写真の隣ですね。冷めたお茶と果物が写っています。写真は残して、もう腐っている実物の果物を片付けます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D012-S01",
    "C37-D012-S02",
    "C37-D012-S03",
    "C37-D012-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 89.685,
   "end_sec": 100.897,
   "duration_sec": 11.212
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "果物は片付けます。燃えるごみの日を確認してください。机を汚したくないので、袋に入れましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D013-S01",
    "C37-D013-S02",
    "C37-D013-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 101.247,
   "end_sec": 108.347,
   "duration_sec": 7.1
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "ベルが鳴りました。原さんですか。ずっと待っていて、髪も乱れています。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D014-S01",
    "C37-D014-S02",
    "C37-D014-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 108.697,
   "end_sec": 113.704,
   "duration_sec": 5.007
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C37-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "原さんは明日です。今は日本語の会の人でしょう。私はベルを鳴らした人を迎えます。まず電気を点けてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C37-D015-S01",
    "C37-D015-S02",
    "C37-D015-S03",
    "C37-D015-S04"
   ],
