   "unit_id": "C37-D011",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西田",
   "text": "処分するのは、写真ではなく、撮影に使った果物です。",
   "start_sec": 85.132,
   "end_sec": 89.335,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D012-S01",
   "unit_id": "C37-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "わかりました。",
   "start_sec": 89.685,
   "end_sec": 90.704,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D012-S02",
   "unit_id": "C37-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "犬一頭と鳥二羽の写真の隣ですね。",
   "start_sec": 90.854,
   "end_sec": 94.153,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D012-S03",
   "unit_id": "C37-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "冷めたお茶と果物が写っています。",
   "start_sec": 94.303,
   "end_sec": 96.636,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D012-S04",
   "unit_id": "C37-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "写真は残して、もう腐っている実物の果物を片付けます。",
   "start_sec": 96.786,
   "end_sec": 100.897,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D013-S01",
   "unit_id": "C37-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西田",
   "text": "果物は片付けます。",
   "start_sec": 101.247,
   "end_sec": 102.734,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D013-S02",
   "unit_id": "C37-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西田",
   "text": "燃えるごみの日を確認してください。",
   "start_sec": 102.884,
   "end_sec": 105.238,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D013-S03",
   "unit_id": "C37-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西田",
   "text": "机を汚したくないので、袋に入れましょう。",
   "start_sec": 105.388,
   "end_sec": 108.347,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D014-S01",
   "unit_id": "C37-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "ベルが鳴りました。",
   "start_sec": 108.697,
   "end_sec": 109.91,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D014-S02",
   "unit_id": "C37-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "原さんですか。",
   "start_sec": 110.06,
   "end_sec": 111.319,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D014-S03",
   "unit_id": "C37-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "ずっと待っていて、髪も乱れています。",
   "start_sec": 111.469,
   "end_sec": 113.704,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D015-S01",
   "unit_id": "C37-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西田",
   "text": "原さんは明日です。",
   "start_sec": 114.054,
   "end_sec": 115.56,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D015-S02",
   "unit_id": "C37-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西田",
   "text": "今は日本語の会の人でしょう。",
   "start_sec": 115.71,
   "end_sec": 117.934,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D015-S03",
   "unit_id": "C37-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西田",
   "text": "私はベルを鳴らした人を迎えます。",
   "start_sec": 118.084,
   "end_sec": 120.604,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C37-D015-S04",
   "unit_id": "C37-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西田",
   "text": "まず電気を点けてください。",
   "start_sec": 120.754,
   "end_sec": 122.473,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  }
 ]
}
